<div class="page-wrapper">
    <NavBanner />
    <div id="cards" class="main-wrapper for-whom-flex">
      <section class="section-hero badge-spacing for-whom-bg v7-1">
        <div id="banner-trigger" class="nav_banner-trigger"></div><img src="/images/logoStripMobileTech.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/logoStripMobileTech-p-500.avif 500w, /images/logoStripMobileTech-p-800.avif 800w, /images/logoStripMobileTech-p-1080.avif 1080w, /images/logoStripMobileTech.avif 1436w" alt="" class="absolute-img-for-whom mobile"><img src="/images/logoStripDesktopTec.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px" srcset="/images/logoStripDesktopTec-p-500.png 500w, /images/logoStripDesktopTec-p-800.png 800w, /images/logoStripDesktopTec-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/logoStripDesktopTec-p-1600.png 1600w, /images/logoStripDesktopTec.avif 2560w" alt="" class="absolute-img-for-whom mobile-hide">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1280 w-container">
          <div class="gap-60-hero center for-whom-hero">
            <div class="left-hero max-w-510 center max-w-800">
              <div class="gap-4">
                <p class="text-caps">Tech explainer video</p>
                <h1 class="h1">Turning complex technology <span class="span-pink-2"> into video people understand</span></h1>
              </div>
              <div class="text-16-150 color-white-80">When your product is complex, getting people to understand its value can take too long. We turn technical ideas, workflows, and features into clear, engaging videos that show how your technology works, why it matters, and what makes it worth choosing without losing the details that make it credible.</div>
              <div class="wrap-btn">
                <div class="wrapper-btn">
                  <div data-w-id="3e6cbf2e-007d-7623-22f4-04c01a120a13" class="glowing-wrapper glowing-wrapper-active gradient">
                    <div class="glowing-wrapper-borders-masker">
                      <div class="glowing-wrapper-borders"></div>
                    </div>
                    <a href="#get-sample" class="glowing-wrapper-button w-inline-block">
                      <div class="text-block rel align-center-middle">Get free sample</div>
                    </a>
                  </div>
                  <div data-w-id="466f40c3-5c77-7bdf-d208-33a17f6e6002" class="glowing-wrapper glowing-wrapper-active">
                    <div class="glowing-wrapper-borders-masker">
                      <div class="glowing-wrapper-borders"></div>
                    </div>
                    <a href="/pricing/motion-graphics-price" class="glowing-wrapper-button w-inline-block">
                      <div class="text-block rel align-center-middle">See pricing</div>
                    </a>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-layout-vflex gap-20 max-w-1200">
              <div data-w-id="0f10fb09-4453-a464-362a-98262a4d1966" class="card">
                <div class="card-content-padding-40">
                  <div class="for-whom-strip">
                    <div id="w-node-_0f10fb09-4453-a464-362a-98262a4d1969-91274962" class="w-layout-hflex flex-h _16 _w-hug align-center-middle">
                      <div class="w-layout-hflex flex-h _8">
                        <h3 class="heading-48">79%</h3>
                      </div>
                      <div class="text-16-150 opacity-80 center-small sizing-x">of our clients<br>sell software</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="line-gradient-2 static small vertical"></div>
                    <div id="w-node-_0f10fb09-4453-a464-362a-98262a4d1974-91274962" class="w-layout-hflex flex-h _16 _w-hug">
                      <div class="w-layout-hflex gap-0 relative">
                        <h3 class="heading-48">58%</h3>
                      </div>
                      <div class="text-16-150 opacity-80 center-small sizing-x">of everything we make <br>is an explainer video</div>
                    </div>
                    <div id="w-node-_0f10fb09-4453-a464-362a-98262a4d197e-91274962" class="line-gradient-2 static small vertical trans"></div>
                    <div id="w-node-_0f10fb09-4453-a464-362a-98262a4d197f-91274962" class="w-layout-hflex flex-h _16 _w-hug">
                      <h3 class="heading-48">500+</h3>
                      <div class="text-16-150 opacity-80 center-small sizing-x">videos delivered <br>every year</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section-insight for-whom">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1408 horizontal w-container">
          <div class="column-wrapper">
            <div class="top_side-slider-2 left center-sm">
              <div class="gap-4-purpose">
                <div class="text-12-caps-2 opacity-60">What we learned</div>
                <div class="max-w-380-slider full">
                  <h2 class="h2">Tech buyers need <span class="span-pink-2">more than big claims</span></h2>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="text-16-150-3 opacity-80">Your technology might be faster, smarter, or genuinely different. But buyers still need to see the proof. Clear information, real product detail, and a believable demonstration give them something they can understand, trust, and assess for themselves.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-layout-vflex list-wrap">
              <div class="card-2">
                <div class="card-content-why_choose-3 direction-horizontal padding-tight"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Key-Insight-Icon---01.avif" alt="A purple circle with a play button on it" class="img-why_choose">
                  <div class="text-14-150-3 opacity-80">82% of tech buyers trust peer recommendations more than what a vendor says about itself. Your video still needs to earn that trust by being clear, specific, and believable.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-2">
                <div class="card-content-why_choose-3 direction-horizontal padding-tight"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Key-Insight-Icon---02.avif" alt="A purple button with a blue envelope on it" class="img-why_choose">
                  <div class="text-14-150-3 opacity-80">45% of developers say poor or inaccurate technical information is their biggest barrier to trying something new. A clear explanation can be the difference between curiosity and drop-off.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-2">
                <div class="card-content-why_choose-3 direction-horizontal padding-tight"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Key-Insight-Icon---03.avif" alt="A purple button with a speaker inside of it" class="img-why_choose">
                  <div class="text-14-150-3 opacity-80">Developers and engineers have little patience for content that feels vague, exaggerated, or overly sales-led. They want useful information they can assess for themselves.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-2">
                <div class="card-content-why_choose-3 direction-horizontal padding-tight"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Key-Insight-Icon---04.avif" alt="A purple button with a shopping cart on it" class="img-why_choose">
                  <div class="text-14-150-3 opacity-80">Buyers who have seen a product working are much more likely to convert than those reached through marketing alone, up to six times more likely in some benchmarks.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="column-wrapper hide-small"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67601fee10470581a90722d7/67602bd27d29b464069f8f7a_Key%20Insight.png" alt=""></div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section-purpose for-whom">
        <div class="line-gradient-2"></div><img sizes="(max-width: 2401px) 100vw, 2401px" srcset="/images/Frame-1707478540_2Frame-1707478540.avif 500w, /images/Frame-1707478540_2.avif 2401w" alt="" src="/images/Frame-1707478540_2.avif" loading="lazy" class="image-purpose-3">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1408 w-container">
          <div class="slider-wrapper-4">
            <div class="top_side-slider-2">
              <div class="gap-4-purpose">
                <div class="text-12-caps-2 opacity-60">The Advantages</div>
                <div class="max-w-380-slider full">
                  <h2 class="h2"><span class="span-pink-2">What makes video so valuable</span><br>for tech companies</h2>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="text-16-150-5 opacity-80">Video helps people understand what your technology does, see where its value comes from, and remember why it is different.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-layout-hflex hor-list-wrap-2">
              <div class="card-5">
                <div class="ai-essential-list-3">
                  <div class="w-layout-hflex hor-title"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Why-AI-Icon---01.avif" alt="A white circle with blue squares in it" class="img-icn">
                    <h3 class="h4">Visualise</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-14-150-6 opacity-80">Show the systems, data flows, automation, and connections that screenshots and static copy struggle to capture.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-5">
                <div class="ai-essential-list-3">
                  <div class="w-layout-hflex hor-title"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Why-AI-Icon---02.avif" alt="An icon of a book with a star on it" class="img-icn">
                    <h3 class="h4">Validate</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-14-150-6 opacity-80">Support product claims by showing the technology solving a real problem, completing a workflow, or producing a meaningful result.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-5">
                <div class="ai-essential-list-3">
                  <div class="w-layout-hflex hor-title"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Why-AI-Icon---03.avif" alt="A purple star in a white circle" class="img-icn">
                    <h3 class="h4">Translate</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-14-150-6 opacity-80">Turn technical features into clear buyer value without removing the details that make them credible.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-5">
                <div class="ai-essential-list-3">
                  <div class="w-layout-hflex hor-title"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Why-AI-Icon---04.avif" alt="A purple icon of a person with a question mark" class="img-icn">
                    <h3 class="h4">Align</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-14-150-6 opacity-80">Give buyers, engineers, investors, and partners a shared understanding of what the product does and why it matters.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div><img sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/Frame-1707478801_1-p-500.png 500w, /images/Frame-1707478801_1-p-800.png 800w, /images/Frame-1707478801_1.avif 1351w" alt="A woman holding a tennis racquet on top of a tennis court" src="/images/Frame-1707478801_1.avif" loading="lazy" class="image-purpose-4">
      </section>
      <div class="customer-stories">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1408 w-container">
          <div class="slider-wrapper-2">
            <div class="top_side-slider-2">
              <div class="gap-4-purpose">
                <div class="text-12-caps-2 opacity-60">CUSTOMER STORIES</div>
                <div class="max-w-380-slider full">
                  <h2 class="h2"><span class="span-pink-2">How we helped LightYear</span> <br>simplify telecom solutions</h2>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="text-16-150-5 opacity-80">Let&#x27;s look at an example of our work with Lightyear AI, a platform that simplifies telecom procurement and management.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-layout-hflex hor-list-wrap hug-h">
              <div class="card _60 custom-bg">
                <div class="customer-story">
                  <div class="w-layout-hflex hor-title"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Light-year-Logo.png" alt="The lightyear logo with an arrow pointing to the right" class="client-logo"></div>
                  <div class="text-16-150-5 opacity-80">LightYear came to us for a set of animated explainer videos to highlight their enterprise telecom software. We delivered three impactful videos (60, 30, and 15 seconds) that not only made their complex product easy to understand but also impressed with exceptional quality—all while staying within budget &amp; timeline.</div>
                  <div class="bullet-list">
                    <p class="paragraph-2">What did we do?</p>
                    <div class="what-we-do-list w-richtext">
                      <ul role="list">
                        <li>Crafted a series of animated explainer videos (60, 30, and 15 seconds) to break down LightYear’s software in a simple, engaging way.</li>
                        <li>Used creative animations to bring their product’s value to life and make it easy for their audience to grasp.</li>
                        <li>Delivered high-quality videos on time, offering great value that exceeded expectations.</li>
                        <li>Stayed in constant communication to make sure everything was on track and aligned with LightYear’s vision.</li>
                        <li>Provided outstanding value, offering top-notch animation work at a price that beat the competition.</li>
                      </ul>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card _40 custom-bg">
                <div class="customer-story video-wrap">
                  <div class="video-wrap">
                    <div style="padding-top:56.17021276595745%" class="w-embed-youtubevideo youtube z-99"><iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/_LRmRuRcSpU?rel=0&amp;controls=1&amp;autoplay=0&amp;mute=0&amp;start=0" frameborder="0" style="position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:auto" allow="autoplay; encrypted-media" allowfullscreen="" title="Lightyear | 2D and 3D SAAS Explainer"></iframe></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="testimonial">
                    <div class="text-16-150 color-white-80 large-sm">&quot;The videos were well done. Motion The Agency excelled at project management and communicated effectively through virtual meetings, emails, and messages. Their high-quality portfolio and the excellent value for money they offered also contributed to the project&#x27;s overall success.&quot;</div>
                    <div class="author-block margin-top">
                      <div id="w-node-_162f7f3f-a05a-7878-eb4c-2ee174a92e6d-91274962" class="text-16-150 text-weight-600 _14-small opacity-80">Dennis Thankachan</div>
                      <div class="text-14-150 _12-small opacity-80">CEO, Lightyear</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
